#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.picmi.appdata.xml:10
msgid "Puzzle game based on number logic"
msgstr "Xuegu de puzzles basáu na llóxica numbérica"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.picmi.appdata.xml:12
msgid ""
"The goal is to reveal the hidden pattern in the board by coloring or leaving "
"blank the cells in a grid according to numbers given at the side of the "
"grid. This is a single player game."
msgstr ""
"La meta ye revelar el patrón anubríu nel tableru coloriando o dexando "
"blanques les caxelles nun rexáu acordies colos númberos daos al llau del "
"rexáu. Esti ye un xuegu d'un xugador."
